{"id":"[REDACTED]","object":"chat.completion","created":1790942209,"model":"mercury-2","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"record_type\": \"reduction\",\n  \"summary\": \"The audit examined the full set of 48 changed files (candidate inventory fully covered) across the Mercury bridge repository. Substantive defects were identified in configuration handling (silent defaults in flagFromEnv and optionalEnvBoolean) and in provider fallback logic (removal of Opus fallback). Several mechanical violations were recorded: added throws and enforced error messages in config and adversarial-review modules, and a function rename that may break callers. Multiple units remain unresolved due to malformed shard outputs or incomplete AST fragments, leaving their impact uncertain. No additional defects were found in the examined source fragments.\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/adversarial-review.js\",\n      \"lines\": \"122-129\",\n      \"issue\": \"Silent default: flagFromEnv returns false for any unrecognized environment value without diagnostic output.\",\n      \"type\": \"SUBSTANTIVE\",\n      \"basis\": \"TESTIMONY\",\n      \"resolution\": \"convergence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/config.js\",\n      \"lines\": \"81-87\",\n      \"issue\": \"Silent default: optionalEnvBoolean returns false for any unrecognized environment value without warning.\",\n      \"type\": \"SUBSTANTIVE\",\n      \"basis\": \"TESTIMONY\",\n      \"resolution\": \"convergence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/provider-preflight.js\",\n      \"lines\": \"232-246\",\n      \"issue\": \"Fallback to Opus when the Fable client fails has been removed, reducing provider coverage and potentially causing pre‑flight failures.\",\n      \"type\": \"SUBSTANTIVE\",\n      \"basis\": \"TESTIMONY\",\n      \"resolution\": \"UNRESOLVED-FOR-TREY\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"t